


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_73fbac48:


    "——情人节当天。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_e6902404:


    "伦焦灼地挂断了手机通话。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_e4e1cfea:



    voice "2RI_1608"
    rin "「……完全不接嘛」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_45fb47f8:


    "伦所拨打的当然是文的电话。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_c0cfc563:



    voice "2RI_1609"
    rin "「搞什么啊……文」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_9ede0abd:


    "打给文的理由则是因为午休都结束了而文却还没来学校。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_a0c0f423:


    "伦在课间休息的时间给文打过电话但是没打通。打到她家里也一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_5cfab1e7:



    voice "2RI_1610"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_77a0c668:


    "伦若有所思的望着手机的画面，上面显示的是文她家的店『洛·巧克·巧克』的号码。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_372fdf90:


    "再三犹豫之后，伦紧咬着嘴唇地按下了拨号。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_0fd4d656:


    "…………"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_f87707bb:



    voice "2RI_1611"
    rin "「啊，很抱歉打扰您了。我是和文住同一间宿舍的绪方伦，由于今天文她没有来上课——」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_fbf4b60f:



    voice "2RI_1612"
    rin "「诶，去了……美容院吗？好的，我明白了。不，抱歉让您在百忙之中接这个电话……好的再见」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_73654920:



    voice "2HI_1576"
    hina "「你又打电话给浅生了吗？打通了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_9380b5e8:


    "阳菜和圣夜子来到伦的座位这边。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_445455c7:



    voice "2RI_1613"
    rin "「没有……我打到店里了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_4811cbde:



    voice "2HI_1577"
    hina "「诶，别人都这么忙了你这不是添乱嘛！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_b2822f1a:


    "只要稍微想一想就知道情人节时的点心店有多忙。阳菜会责备伦也是无可厚非的。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_0cf4f0cf:



    voice "2RI_1614"
    rin "「我当然知道啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_a041f5ab:


    "没错，伦自己也应当知晓的。然而还是控制不住。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_5fdd5733:



    voice "2HI_1578"
    hina "「……然后呢，那边怎么说？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_265e2f62:


    "阳菜话语间夹着叹息地问道。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_17d9c6c3:



    voice "2RI_1615"
    rin "「说是文去了美容院来着」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_abba2d2a:



    voice "2MI_1055"
    miyako "「美容院？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_cbab6c84:



    voice "2RI_1616"
    rin "「因为她要去试镜了啊……文要远离我而去了……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_46391f19:


    "伦咔哒一下地顶开椅子站了起来，然后踉踉跄跄地往出口走去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_0f46aee2:



    voice "2HI_1579"
    hina "「伦！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_5500da56:


    "阳菜的声音让伦停下了脚步。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_bc9060d7:



    voice "2RI_1617"
    rin "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_f8ceb92e:


    "经过了漫长的徘徊之后，伦一下子瘫坐在了座位上。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_bc5c2a4f:



    voice "2RI_1618"
    rin "「……毕竟这是文的选择」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_01272cf5:



    voice "2HI_1580"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_05130a41:


    "阳菜轻轻地拍了拍伦的后背。"




translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_65ce3a83:


    voice "2RI_1611"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou3_07_9e3545b7:


    rin "「啊，很抱歉打扰您了。我是和文住同一间宿舍的绪方伦，由于今天文她没有来上课——」"
